rface":"நறும்புகை","parts":[{"text":"நறும்புகை","lemma":"நறும்புகை","gloss":"fragrant smoke"}],"gloss":"fragrant smoke","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஞெகிழி","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழி","lemma":"ஞெகிழி","gloss":"firebrand"}],"gloss":"firebrand"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான","parts":[{"text":"வான","lemma":"வான","gloss":"of the sky"}],"gloss":"of the sky","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மீனின்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"மீன்","gloss":"star"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"comparative suffix"}],"gloss":"like stars"},{"surface":"வயின்வயின்","parts":[{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"place"},{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"here and there"},{"surface":"இமைக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இமை","lemma":"இமை","gloss":"twinkle"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"க்கும்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"twinkling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓங்குமலை","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கு","lemma":"ஓங்கு","gloss":"high"},{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"high mountain"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"masculine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"},{"surface":"சாந்து","parts":[{"text":"சாந்து","lemma":"சாந்து","gloss":"sandalwood paste"}],"gloss":"sandalwood paste"},{"surface":"புலர்","parts":[{"text":"புலர்","lemma":"புலர்","gloss":"dry"}],"gloss":"drying"},{"surface":"அகலம்","parts":[{"text":"அகலம்","lemma":"அகலம்","gloss":"chest"}],"gloss":"chest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உள்ளின்","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"think"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"conditional suffix"}],"gloss":"if thinking of"},{"surface":"உண்ணோய்","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"inner"},{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain"}],"gloss":"inner pain"},{"surface":"மல்கும்","parts":[{"text":"மல்கு","lemma":"மல்கு","gloss":"increase"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"future/habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"increases"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புல்லின்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"embrace"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"conditional suffix"}],"gloss":"if embracing"},{"surface":"மாய்வது","parts":[{"text":"மாய்","lemma":"மாய்","gloss":"perish"},{"text":"வது","lemma":"வது","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"perishing"},{"surface":"எவன்","parts":[{"text":"எவன்","lemma":"எவன்","gloss":"what"}],"gloss":"what"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of wonder"}],"gloss":"particle of wonder"},{"surface":"அன்னாய்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னாய்","lemma":"அன்னை","gloss":"mother/friend"}],"gloss":"O mother / O friend"}]}],"literal":"The hillman kindled fragrant smoke firebrand / like sky stars here and there twinkling / high mountain lord's sandalwood-dried chest / if thinking of, inner pain increases / if embracing, why does it perish, O mother!","translation":"O mother! When I think of the lord of the high mountains—where the fragrant-wood torches lit by the watchmen on their high platforms twinkle here and there like stars in the sky—my inner pain increases. But if I embrace his chest, dried of sandalwood paste, why does that pain vanish?","modern":"பரண் மேல் இருப்பவன் ஏற்றிய நறுமணப் புகையுடைய தீப்பந்தம், வானத்து விண்மீன்களைப் போல அங்கங்கே இமைக்கும் உயர்ந்த மலைநாட்டினது தலைவனுடைய, சந்தனம் உலர்ந்த மார்பினை நினைத்தால் என் மனநோய் மிகும்; தழுவினால் அது நீங்குவது ஏனோ, தோழியே!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her foster-mother or close friend about her deep love for the lord of the mountain country. She describes the mountain landscape where watchmen on high platforms light fragrant torches that twinkle in the night like stars. This vivid image of distant, twinkling lights reflects her own state of longing and the constant, flickering hope in her heart. She explains a paradox: merely thinking of her lover's chest, which is adorned with drying sandalwood paste, intensifies her inner affliction. Yet, the moment she is united with him in an embrace, all her suffering completely vanishes.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.3],[2.3,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.3],[3.3,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.62],[5.62,5.8],[5.8,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,10.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.8],[2.8,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,4.0],[4.0,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.36],[6.36,6.6],[6.6,7.29],[7.29,7.71],[7.71,8.4],[8.4,9.47],[9.47,9.47],[9.47,9.47],[9.47,10.9]]}}